			"notes": "# Spawner Protect 1.0.0 — by Alatic\n\nPublic release for Minecraft 1.21.11, Meteor Client, Fabric and Java 21.\n\n- Silk Touch stacked-spawner recovery with visible movement, aim and crouch cycling.\n- Batched ender-chest deposits with server snapshot verification.\n- Player breaking, surface digging, TNT, TNT minecart, wither and blue-skull detection.\n- Optional outlines and alarm; exclusive recovery control over Meteor modules.\n- MIT license and Alatic attribution throughout the original source.\n\nInstall the JAR in `mods`, remove older versions and restart Minecraft. See README for settings and detection limitations. Existing saved settings are preserved. Automated build checks pass; server-specific behavior requires in-game validation."
